WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:04.190
For this quiz I want you
to fix this website.

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:06.740
You'll be trying out
Calc with these images.

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.039
But this time,

00:00:08.039 --> 00:00:11.970
I want you to fit these three images
all the way across the screen.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:15.450
Each of the three images will need to
be a third of the available width, and

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:18.310
there should be a ten
pixel margin between them.

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:22.660
Pop open dev tools and inside
the head you'll find this style tag.

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:24.910
Inside the style tag,
you'll see some comments.

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:27.600
These are the places where I
want you to make some changes.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.320
You can find a link to the website
in the instructor notes.

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:32.259
When all three images
are aligned correctly,

00:00:32.259 --> 00:00:38.010
with ten pixels between these images,
a code will appear on the website.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:39.970
Type that code into
this box to continue.

